### Daughters of Sun — API de prueba
### Requiere la extensión "REST Client" (Huachao Mao) para el botón "Send Request".
### Servidor: pnpm run start:dev (puerto 3000). Datos: pnpm run seed.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@orgId = 0fb476e3-f475-406e-abbe-0ad1e3dc53c3
@propertyId = 5a429b81-bf13-476b-97d8-409bb7a55c4b
@standardDobleId = e2ee9954-d2ac-4608-9552-5fee02bf3263
@suiteTerrazaId = 17160091-ac11-42da-b848-dba2636bf61d

### 1. Login como Julius (OWNER)
# @name loginOwner
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "julius@daughtersofsun.test",
  "password": "OwnerDev123!"
}

### 2. Quién soy (usa el token de arriba automáticamente)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3. Ver el catálogo: propiedades de la org
GET {{baseUrl}}/orgs/{{orgId}}/properties
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Ver los tipos de unidad de la property
GET {{baseUrl}}/orgs/{{orgId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/unit-types
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.accessToken}}

### 5. Disponibilidad de Standard Doble en un rango de fechas
### Cambiá las fechas a gusto — hoy hay reservas de prueba dispersas en varios rangos.
GET {{baseUrl}}/orgs/{{orgId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/unit-types/{{standardDobleId}}/availability?checkIn=2027-03-01&checkOut=2027-03-05
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.accessToken}}

### 6. Crear una reserva (asigna unidad automático, calcula precio)
# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/orgs/{{orgId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitTypeId": "{{standardDobleId}}",
  "checkIn": "2027-03-01",
  "checkOut": "2027-03-05",
  "guests": 2,
  "guestFullName": "Prueba Manual",
  "guestEmail": "prueba.manual@example.com",
  "guestPhone": "+507 6000-0000"
}

### 7. Repetir disponibilidad — debería bajar en 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/orgs/{{orgId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/unit-types/{{standardDobleId}}/availability?checkIn=2027-03-01&checkOut=2027-03-05
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.accessToken}}

### 8. Listar todas las reservas de la property
GET {{baseUrl}}/orgs/{{orgId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.accessToken}}

### 9. Check-in de la reserva que acabás de crear
POST {{baseUrl}}/orgs/{{orgId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/bookings/{{createBooking.response.body.id}}/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.accessToken}}

### 10. Check-out
POST {{baseUrl}}/orgs/{{orgId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/bookings/{{createBooking.response.body.id}}/check-out
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.accessToken}}

### 11. Intentar check-in de nuevo sobre una reserva ya CHECKED_OUT — debería dar 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/orgs/{{orgId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/bookings/{{createBooking.response.body.id}}/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.accessToken}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### Rol: recepción (FRONT_DESK) — puede crear reservas, no puede crear catálogo
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### 12. Login como recepción
# @name loginFrontDesk
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "recepcion@daughtersofsun.test",
  "password": "FrontDeskDev123!"
}

### 13. Recepción SÍ puede crear una reserva
POST {{baseUrl}}/orgs/{{orgId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{loginFrontDesk.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitTypeId": "{{suiteTerrazaId}}",
  "checkIn": "2027-04-01",
  "checkOut": "2027-04-03",
  "guestFullName": "Otra Prueba",
  "guestEmail": "otra.prueba@example.com"
}

### 14. Recepción NO puede crear una property nueva — 403 esperado
POST {{baseUrl}}/orgs/{{orgId}}/properties
Authorization: Bearer {{loginFrontDesk.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Intento no autorizado",
  "slug": "intento-no-autorizado"
}
